==Finnish==

===Etymology===
*From the Finno-Ugric root *''ede''.

===Pronunciation===
*Hyphenation: e·si
*Rhymes: [[kesi]], [[mesi]], [[vesi]]

===Prefix===
'''esi-'''
#[[pre-]], [[fore-]].

====Inflection====
*The cases of ''esi-'' serve in Finnish only as adverbs. The instructive singular is always used with the enclitic particle ''[[-kin]]'' or ''[[-kään]]''.
